    <string name="setup_welcome_title">Get started</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_body">Brovan runs Windows programs on this phone. Do these four steps before you play.</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_programs">Windows programs</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_programs_body">Games and desktop programs run from their own folder. Brovan does not change them.</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_graphics">Vulkan graphics</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_graphics_body">The phone\'s own GPU driver draws the graphics. Brovan does not emulate them.</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_controls">Touch controls</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome_controls_body">A joystick, D-pad or touchpad replaces the keyboard and mouse.</string>

    <string name="setup_windows_title">Windows system files</string>
    <string name="setup_windows_body">Windows programs need the Windows system libraries, NLS tables and registry hives. Brovan downloads the Windows installation media from Microsoft and extracts only these files. It does not include or redistribute software from Microsoft, so you need a valid Windows license.</string>
    <string name="setup_windows_state_missing">Not installed</string>
    <string name="setup_windows_state_installed">Installed</string>

    <string name="setup_runtimes_title">Visual C++ runtimes</string>
    <string name="setup_runtimes_body">Many programs use Visual C++. These programs stop with a missing DLL error if the runtimes are not installed. The runtimes are not part of Windows, so Brovan downloads them separately.</string>
    <string name="setup_runtimes_note">If your programs include their own libraries, you can skip this step.</string>

    <string name="setup_program_title">Your first program</string>
    <string name="setup_program_body">Add the folder that contains the program and all its files. Brovan copies the folder into its own storage and runs the program from there.</string>
    <string name="setup_program_note">You can add more programs later from the library.</string>
    <string name="setup_program_none">No programs yet</string>
    <string name="setup_program_count">%1$d in your library</string>

